Latitude 23.0, longitude 77.0 is in Madhya Pradesh, India, near Bhopal (23.26, 77.41). The point lies west of Bhopal, close to Sehore, in the Malwa plateau area. Elevation there is about 500 m. Bhopal itself is around 500 m, and Sehore is around 500 m.

The point may fall near the Upper Lake or the Betwa/Narmada region, but 77.0 E at 23.0 N is south-west of Bhopal, near Ashta or Sehore district. Terrain there is roughly 480-520 m, so I'll estimate 495 m.

