Latitude -69, longitude 121 lies in East Antarctica, in Wilkes Land. The Aurora Subglacial Basin is further inland. On the coast near 66°S, 110°E the Law Dome and Totten Glacier region lies at about 116°E. At 69°S, 121°E, the point is about 300 km inland from the coast near the Sabrina coast (~66.5°S), which puts it on the ice sheet.

