The depth in this area is likely about 4,500 m. The Central Indian Basin is around 4,000–5,000 m deep, and the western flank of the Central Indian Ridge at 59°E would be around 3,500–4,500 m. I'll estimate -4,400 m.

{"type":"Water","elevation_m":-4400}

