Wager Bay is at about 65.5N, 88W, which is too far east to matter. Closer to the point are Lake Garry at 66N, 100W and Pelly Lake at 66N, 102W, but these are farther north. Aberdeen Lake is at 64.5N, 99W. At 65N, 101W there are probably small lakes, but the point is most likely on land. I estimate the ground elevation at about 190 m.

