The Middle America Trench lies off Colima, roughly 100 km offshore. The Rivera plate region here has a shelf that is narrow, and depths reach about 2000-3000 m at 50-70 km offshore. At 70 km from the coast the depth is probably around 2500 m, so I'll estimate -2400 m.

