At 45°N, 119°E, this is in Inner Mongolia, China, near the Mongolian border. The area lies in the Hinggan League / Xilingol region, in the Greater Khingan or Dayangshu area. At about 45°N 119°E the terrain is grassland on the Mongolian plateau at roughly 900-1100 m. Ulan Hot is at 46.08°N, 122°E. Xilinhot is at 44°N, 116°E, with an elevation of about 1000 m. Near 119°E, 45°N the area is east of Dong Ujimqin (45.5°N, 116.9°E, ~900 m), toward the Greater Khingan range. Elevation is probably about 800-1000 m. I'll say 850.

