Elevation is uncertain. The Aldan River lies to the north, around 58-59°N, and the Stanovoy Range is further south at about 55-56°N. At 57°N, 127°E the terrain is likely upland of roughly 800-1000 m, though Aldan Highlands elevations could also be around 700 m. The Timpton River basin is near 57°N, 125-127°E, with valleys at around 600-800 m. I'll estimate 850 m.

