10872.text:
The point at latitude -31.0, longitude -35.0 is in the South Atlantic Ocean, east of Brazil and west of the Mid-Atlantic Ridge. This area sits on the Brazil Basin or the Rio Grande Rise region, which lies further south at around -30 to -35 latitude and -30 to -40 longitude. The Rio Grande Rise is centered near 30°S, 35°W, with parts as shallow as about 600 to 1000 m, though the plateau is generally around 2000 to 3000 m deep. The surrounding abyssal plain is about 4500 to 5000 m deep.

