Muriaé sits near -21.13, -42.37 at about 200 m. At -43.0, -21.0 the location is near Visconde do Rio Branco (-21.0, -42.84) and Ubá (-21.12, -42.94). Ubá is at roughly 300 m, and the surrounding hills reach about 400–500 m, so I estimate about 400 m.

{"type":"Solid","elevation_m":400}

7920.text:
