Latitude 83.0°N, longitude -95.0° (95°W) lies north of Ellesmere Island and Axel Heiberg Island. Ellesmere's northern coast is at about 83.1°N near 70–80°W, and Axel Heiberg reaches only about 81°N. Meighen Island is at 80°N. At 95°W, 83°N is in the Arctic Ocean, north of the Canadian Arctic Archipelago, so it is water.

