7735.text:
Location 5°N, 171°E is in the Pacific Ocean, in the Marshall Islands region. The nearest atolls are Ailinglaplap (around 7.4°N, 168.7°E), Jaluit (6°N, 169.5°E), Namorik (5.6°N, 168.1°E), Kili (5.6°N, 169.1°E), and Ebon (4.6°N, 168.7°E). Mili sits at 6.1°N, 171.9°E, and Knox (Narik) at 5.9°N, 171.9°E. So 5°N, 171°E is likely open ocean south of Mili, in deep water.

