The coordinates 55.0°N, 99.0°W fall in northern Manitoba. That is near Wekusko Lake and Nelson House, and Footprint Lake is close by too. Thompson is at about 55.74°N, 97.86°W. Nelson House is at about 55.8°N, 99.0°W. So the point is a bit south of Nelson House, roughly 55.0°N, 99.0°W, which is near Setting Lake or Wekusko Lake.

Wekusko Lake sits at about 54.75°N, 99.9°W. Setting Lake is at about 55.0°N, 98.6°W, so the point may be just west of Setting Lake. Ground elevation in this area is roughly 230 m. I'll treat it as land.

