I estimate about 2900 m.

{"type":"Solid","elevation_m":2900}

8459.text:
Latitude -3.0, longitude 179.0 (179°E) is in the western Pacific, near the Gilbert Islands (Kiribati). The Gilbert Islands lie roughly between 3°N and 3°S at longitudes 172–177°E, and Phoenix Islands are around 171–175°W at about 3–4°S. So 179°E is east of the Gilbert Islands and west of the Phoenix Islands, in open ocean.

