9322.text:
Latitude -13, longitude 105 lies in the Indian Ocean, south of Java and west of Christmas Island (which is at about -10.5, 105.6). The Java Trench lies to the north, and this point is probably on the abyssal plain of the Argo/Wharton basin region south of the trench. Depths there are about 5,000-5,600 m.

