Latitude 81.0°N, longitude 85.0°E lies in the Kara Sea, north of the Taymyr Peninsula. Severnaya Zemlya sits at about 79-81°N and 95-100°E, so this point is west of it. Franz Josef Land is at about 55-65°E, so the point is east of that as well. That leaves open sea in the northern Kara Sea.

