{"type":"Water","elevation_m":-350}

4804.text:
Latitude 37.0, longitude 69.0 falls in northern Afghanistan, in Kunduz/Takhar province, near the Amu Darya region. Kunduz city is at about 36.73N, 68.87E at roughly 400 m elevation. Khanabad is at about 36.68N, 69.1E. At 37.0N, 69.0E the point is north of Kunduz, in the plains toward the Amu Darya, which lies at about 37.1N near Imam Sahib. Imam Sahib is at about 37.2N, 68.95E with an elevation of about 340 m. At 37.0N the elevation is probably around 370 m.

