Latitude 77.0 N, longitude 63.0 W is in northwest Greenland, in Baffin Bay / Smith Sound area. Qaanaaq is at 77.47N, 69.2W, so 63W is further west, in Smith Sound or Inglefield Bredning's mouth. Ellesmere Island lies at about 78N, 75W. At 77N, 63W, the area is open Baffin Bay, west of the Greenland coast, which lies around 68-70W at this latitude. The Greenland coast near Cape York is at about 76N, 66W, and Melville Bay ice edge is near 75-76N, 60W. At 77N, 63W, that is probably west of the Greenland coast, in northern Melville Bay / Baffin Bay, so it is likely water.

