Cape Billings is at 69.9°N, 175.5°E, and Cape Shmidt is at 68.9°N, 179.4°E (west). So at 177°E the coast is around 69.5°N. The point at 69.0°N would be inland, about 50 km from the coast, in the tundra hills of the Chukotka plains with elevations of perhaps 300 m.

