3661.text:
Latitude 49.0 N, longitude -57.0 W is in western Newfoundland. Bay of Islands is at about 49.0 N, -58.0 W, and Corner Brook is at 48.95 N, -57.95 W. At -57.0, the point is inland, east of the Long Range Mountains, near Red Indian Lake (48.7 N, -57.0 W) and the Buchans area (48.8 N, -56.9 W). At 49.0 N it sits north of Red Indian Lake, in the interior of Newfoundland, which is solid land. Elevation there is likely about 300 m.

