Latitude 33.0, longitude 97.0 (positive east) falls in eastern Tibet/Qinghai, near the Qinghai-Tibet border around Zadoi/Chengduo. This is high plateau at roughly 4,500 to 5,000 m. The point is near the Lancang (Mekong) headwaters, at about 33°N, 97°E, in the Nangqên/Zadoi area of southern Qinghai. Terrain there is typically around 4,700 m.

