2020.text:
Latitude 67.0 N, longitude -99.0 W is in Nunavut, Canada. It lies south of the Gulf of Boothia, near the Simpson Peninsula/Committee Bay area. The Boothia Peninsula runs roughly 70 N to 72 N, so 67 N is a bit south of that.

