Latitude 59.0°N, longitude 33.0°E is in Russia, in the Novgorod/Vologda/Leningrad oblast area. Lake Onega is farther north and Lake Ladoga is at about 60-61°N, 31-32°E, so neither covers this point. Lake Beloye is at 60°N, 37.5°E, also too far away.

