At -11, 145 the position is off the shelf edge in the Coral Sea, near the Eastern Plateau and Queensland Trough area. The Queensland Trough reaches about 2000 m deep at around -12, 146. The shelf edge at -11 is near 144 E. Moving east of that, the depth increases to roughly 1000 to 2000 m, and the Queensland Trough is about 2000 m to 2500 m deep at 145 E. I'll estimate -1500 m, though this is a guess.

