The seafloor in this area is the Pacific abyssal plain. Depths near the Line Islands region are typically 4,500–5,500 m, though the area around Kingman and Palmyra sits on a rise. About 100 km from the atolls, the depth is probably around 5,000 m, so I estimate the elevation at roughly -5,100 m.

