6834.text:
Location: 15°N, 169°E is in the Pacific Ocean, west of the Marshall Islands (which lie roughly 5–15°N, 165–172°E). Bikini and Enewetak are at about 11°N, 162–165°E. At 15°N, 169°E, the nearest land is probably Wotje or Ujelang, and neither is that close to this point. Bikar and Utirik are at about 12°N, 170°E, and Taongi at about 14.6°N, 169°E. Taongi Atoll is at 14.6°N, 168.9°E, which is very near the point, only about 0.4° (roughly 45 km) away, so the point is probably open ocean near Taongi.

